<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Payment Received</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;">
    <h1 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-top: 0;">Payment Received</h1>

    <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

    <p>We have successfully received your payment for <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong>. Thank you!</p>

    <div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #3498db;">
      <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Amount:</strong> {{amountPaid}} {{currency}}</p>
      <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;"><strong>Invoice ID:</strong> {{invoiceId}}</p>
    </div>

    <p>Your subscription remains active and your team continues to have full access.</p>

    <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 14px;">
      Keep this email as your payment confirmation. If you have any questions about this charge, please contact our support team quoting the invoice ID above.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; margin: 30px 0;">

    <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
      This is an automated payment confirmation for {{organizationName}}.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
